{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Find the existing software products that already do what an idea, a product name or a website does \u2014 the same search as risetive.com/find. Use this first when the user asks who else does something, what the alternatives are, or whether something already exists. Returns a one-sentence answer (how many products do it and how big the biggest is), what the input was understood as, and the products doing it, each with its one-line description, monthly visits, Paid/Free when known, whether its site is new, and its niche, most visited first, 25 at a time (page.nextOffset asks for the next ones); products with 10M+ monthly visits come apart in giants. Also the niche most of them are in. For a website it also says whether Risetive lists it. When nothing does the idea yet, the nearest products are returned separately. For one product's features and pricing, call risetive_get_product_profile with its domain. A search takes about 10\u201360 seconds and shares the website's per-address and daily search limits. Works without signing in (small daily allowance, at most 5 rows per list); a free Risetive account returns full results. Without an account, at most 5 searches a day.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"idea":{"description":"A product idea in one sentence (\"an app that turns meeting notes into tasks\"), a product name (\"Notion\") or a website (\"notion.so\" or \"https://notion.so\"). Up to 300 characters.","maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"How many competitors to return, 1\u201350; 25 when omitted.","maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"How many of the most visited competitors to skip; pass page.nextOffset from the last answer for the next ones. The same idea on the same day is not searched again.","maxi